# Card

ID: example-card

## Subcomponents

### CardHeader

#### Props

```
export type CardHeaderProps = {
  /** Heading text rendered above the card body. */
  heading: string;
  /**
   * Heading level applied to the rendered element.
   *
   * @default 2
   */
  level?: 2 | 3;
}
```

#### Events

```
export type CardHeaderEvents = {
  /** Fired when the header is dismissed. */
  dismiss: [];
}
```

## Props

```
export type CardProps = {
  /** Body text rendered inside the card. */
  content: string;
  /**
   * Visual density of the card.
   *
   * @default "comfortable"
   */
  density?: "comfortable" | "compact";
}
```

## Slots

Each slot is typed with the props it passes to its content.

```
export type CardSlots = {
  header: {};
}
```